<title>USA: Jefferies Group to buy back 500,000 shares.</title>
<headline>Jefferies Group to buy back 500,000 shares.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jefferies Group Inc said Wednesday its board had authorized the repurchase of up to 500,000 shares of common.</p>
<p>The repurchases will be in addition to current buyback plans, it said.</p>
<p>Further details were unavailable.</p>
</text>
